.TH CLEAR 1 "FUZIX" "Ripple"
.SH NAME
clear \- clear the terminal display
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
clear
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clear the terminal using its termcap definition. TERM selects a terminal
entry in /etc/termcap; ANSI, VT100 and common xterm names are installed.
